<title>FRANCE: TF1 first quarter sales rise.</title>
<headline>TF1 first quarter sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     2,410  vs     2,276</p>
<p>NOTE - Television company TF1's figures were released in the BALO official bulletin. The group said advertising revenue rose 2.3 percent in the first quarter versus 1.1 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
